==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 8.33 seconds<sup>250f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wondermaria (Enemy)|Wondermaria]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Super Devil (Enemy)|Super Devil]] spawns.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Crazed Bahamut Cat]] outranges Wondermaria, allowing to chip off health. Do be aware that a single shot knocks back Wondermaria into the range of the Super Devil, but it helps to make the stage go by faster. If Super Devil kills C. Bahamut, you're just gonna have slowly grind out health of the two witches, possible, but tedious.

